    "plain_text": "Raif Ali Dinçkök is a Turkish industrialist and chairman of Akkök Holding, the family-controlled group spanning chemicals, advanced materials, energy and property. After studying business administration at Boston University, he worked through purchasing and energy roles before joining group leadership. He now chairs several major subsidiaries, including Aksa Akrilik, Akkim and Akiş REIT.",
